function controlsHelp(){openModal('Your apartment is the workshop',`<p>Move things around until the room makes sense. Everything is editable. Nothing here requires an account.</p><ul><li><strong>Furnish:</strong> tap furniture and drag to move; press <span class="kbd">Q</span> / <span class="kbd">E</span> to rotate 15°. Use the catalog below to add objects.</li><li><strong>Build:</strong> select a wall, drag its body to move it or drag glowing endpoints to resize. Choose + Draw wall, then tap start and end points.</li><li><strong>Openings:</strong> select Door, Window, Outlet, or Open Passage in the inspector. Tap a wall to place a marker.</li><li><strong>Explore:</strong> drag empty space to orbit. On desktop, right-drag or Shift-drag pans; wheel zooms. On touch, two fingers pinch and pan.</li><li><strong>Views:</strong> Dollhouse reveals the interior; 3D Orbit provides an outside perspective; Top Plan is easiest for furniture placement.</li><li><strong>Undo:</strong> Ctrl/⌘+Z. Redo Ctrl/⌘+Shift+Z. Delete removes selected objects.</li></ul><p>The original apartment geometry is <strong>estimated</strong>. Measure walls and verify doors, windows, and outlets before making permanent changes.</p>`);}
